The following system is a Hessenberg (pure) index-2 DAE
\begin{equation}\label{eq:index2 picked from Petzol's computer method}
    \left. \begin{aligned}
    \dot{y}_1 &= \lambda y_1 - z, \\
    \dot{y}_2 &= (2\lambda - \sin^2 t) y_2 + (\sin^2 t) (y_1 - 1)^2, \\
