Consider a factor $w$ of a recurrent infinite word ${\bf u} = u_0 u_1 u_2 \cdots$. Let $j < \ell$ be two consecutive occurrences of $w$ in $\bf u$. Then the word $u_j u_{j+1} \cdots u_{\ell-1}$ is a~\emph{return word} to $w$ in~$\bf u$.

