=\dfrac{4+11\sum_{j=0}^{3n+2}6^j+44\sum_{j=0}^{n}6^{3j+1}+\frac{1}{5}\sum_{j=0}^{n}(99\cdot 6^{3j}-9)}{33 \cdot 6^{3n+2}}\\
