=\dfrac{4+\frac{11}{5}(6^{3n+3}-1)+\frac{44\cdot 6}{215}(6^{3n+3}-1)+\frac{99}{5\cdot 215}(6^{3n+3}-1)-\frac{9}{5}(n+1)}{33 \cdot 6^{3n+2}}\\
\\
<\dfrac{688}{1075}+\dfrac{4}{33\cdot 6^{3n+2}}<\dfrac{19}{22}\,. \\
\end{array}$$
