=\dfrac{9+\frac{66\cdot 6^{3n+2}+9}{5}+\frac{1}{5}\sum_{j=0}^{n}(99\cdot6^{3j+1}-9)+44\sum_{j=0}^{n-1}6^{3j+2}}{22 \cdot 6^{3n+2}}\\
\\
<\dfrac{817}{1075}+\dfrac{9}{110\cdot 6^{3n+1}}<\dfrac{19}{22}\,. \\
