\subsection{3-dimensional Orbifold Data}
\label{subsubsec:3dOrbDat}

Recall from \Cref{subsubsec:2dOrbDat} that 2-dimensional orbifold data are $\Delta$-separable symmetric Frobenius algebras in a given pivotal 2-category. 
As indicated in \Cref{rem:2dOrbifoldData} they arise by demanding invariance under 2-dimensional Pachner moves. 
Here we review the analogous discussion in three dimensions, following \cite{Carqueville2012, Carqueville2017, Carqueville2023}. 

