   \ub \ .\notag
\end{align*}
In particular,  $\Sigma_T=\frac{(\sigma^2 T +\sigma_\beta^2)\sigma^2_\Xi}{\sigma_{e}^2 }
     \vb\vb^\top$ and we have the asymptotics
\begin{align}\label{eq:sigma-equivalent}
\notag
\wb^\top\Sigma_t^{-1}\wb& \sim_{t\uparrow T}\frac{
   |\wb|^4
   }
   {  \sigma^2(T-t)\left(\frac{\sigma_{e}^2}{v^2}-\vare^2\gamma^2\right)} \ ,\quad
