With the PRATUSH baseline design in place, a ground-based concept model is under development. The concept model is expected to lead to the engineering model followed by the flight model subject to experiment (mission) approval. The multi-fold goals of the concept model in leading up to the engineering model are listed below. 
\begin{itemize}
    \item To demonstrate reduction in power-mass-volume specifications of electronics compared to the ground-based predecessor experiment - SARAS \citep{JN2021}.
