	&\leq \! \left(\frac{\exp (k D(P_j \| P_V))}{\exp(k D(P_i \| P_V))}\right)  \exp\!\left(\!-n\! \left[E_{\mathrm{x}}^{\prime}({Q_{\hat{j}}}, \rho_{ij})\!-\!\rho_{ij}R_j \right]\right).
