Having evaluated the expectation in~\eqref{eq-lem-exp}, we now obtain the following bound on the error probability of the code in Lemma~\ref{lem-expurgation-jscc} as follows
\begin{align}
	p_e(\mcl{C}) 
	&= \sum_{\bs{v}} P^k(\bs{v})\, p_e(\bs{v},\mcl{C})\\
	\begin{split}
