\end{equation}
where $Pr_{ij}(\mathbf{p};\mathcal{M}_{k}) = \frac{\exp(\psi_{ij})}{1 + \sum_{j'=1}^{J}\exp(\psi_{ij'})}$ refers to the choice probability of consumer $i$ for brand $j$ under our model and $\psi_{ij} = \alpha_{0} p_{j} +
