By taking the derivative of $R(\mathbf{p})$ with respect to each brand's price $p_{j}$, we obtain the optimal uniform pricing condition under our demand model as shown below.
%For notational convenience, let $e_{ij} = \exp(\psi_{ij})$ and $\Lambda_{i}(e) = \sum_{j\in [J]} e_{ij}$.
