    \caption{Digital implementation schematic of the somatic operation of an ALIF neuron: 
    (a) ALIF neuron dynamics \eqref{eq:alif_dynamics} and
    (b) adaptive threshold mechanism \eqref{eq:adap_vthr_alif}. 
